  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, it's not possible to show, for example a peace sign with the index controllers, as they don't sense finger spread. This means that your peace bind can end up looking very different (see attached image for example).\n\nSome form of control over finger spread is therefore needed - for example, if the finger spread settings of gesture overrides were applied when the gesture was identified (with curl still coming from the controller) this would resolve this issue.",
